{"id":"svobodno","lemma":"свободно","pos":"adv","rank":2142,"glosses":["freely (without interference or restriction)","freely, easily (without difficulties)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Простите, здесь свободно?","en":"Excuse me, is this seat free?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/679271","words":[{"g":"to excuse","l":"простить"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Это место свободно?","en":"Is that seat free?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"place, spot"},null]},{"text":"Вы можете говорить свободно?","en":"Are you at liberty to talk?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null]},{"text":"Они поддержали его право говорить свободно.","en":"They supported his right to speak freely.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to support","l":"поддержать"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"right"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null]},{"text":"Я свободно могу говорить по-французски.","en":"I can speak French fluently.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},{"g":"along / by"},null]}]}